      <atom:link href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/15/arts/music/oliver-jones-dead.html" rel="standout"></atom:link>
      <description>Growing up in the shadow of the piano giant Oscar Peterson, he became a jazz institution in his own right and collected an array of honors.</description>
      <dc:creator>Alex Williams</dc:creator>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 18:44:11 +0000</pubDate>
      <category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_per">Jones, Oliver (1934-2026)</category>
